### Credential Dumping Activity

Detects potential credential dumping through Mimikatz-related indicators.

```spl
index=sysmon EventCode=1 (Image="*mimik*tz.exe" OR CommandLine="*sekurlsa*" OR CommandLine="*lsadump*")
```

**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1003 - *S Credential Dumping

---

### DCS*nc Attack Detection

Detects Activ* Directory replication abuse associated with DCSync attacks.

```spl
